{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "label": "ADR 0030 \u2014 The manifest commits to its hostnames and realms once (superseded)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Superseded 2026-09-03 by ADR 0031: hostnames and realms left with the remotes block; the window it describes is now the reason there will not be a remote."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_run_app_hostnames_permanent", "label": "The calculator keeps its *.run.app hostnames, permanently", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The indirection argument for a custom domain nearly won; it collapsed because a project migrated into an organisation keeps its id, number and resource URLs."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_move_project_never_recreate", "label": "Move the project, never recreate it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recreating is the only thing that could move Cloud Run hostnames; declined in writing rather than insured against at \u00a330\u201340/month."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_three_realms_us_eu_gb", "label": "Three realms: US, EU and GB", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The UK is not inside EU (Frankfurt/Dublin); GB is London; the first customer is a UK company; confirmed by forge lint accepting GB and rejecting ZZ."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_gb_london_service", "label": "GB points at a London service, not Frankfurt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declaring a realm while computing elsewhere would falsify the sentence that the app never decides a tenant's region."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_undeclared_realm_unknown", "label": "What a tenant pinned to an undeclared realm gets is unknown", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refused install vs silent fall-through to default; open question with Atlassian decides whether DE and CH are added."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_region_loop_in_deploy_workflow", "label": "A third region is a change to the deploy workflow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A hand-deployed service would stop receiving versions while checks stayed green; a stale service answering a customer is the worst failure class."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_rejected_custom_domain", "label": "Rejected: custom domain via a load balancer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "$18\u201325 per region per month, ten times the bill; the real argument is recorded so it is not refused for the wrong reason."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_rejected_domain_mappings", "label": "Rejected: Cloud Run direct domain mappings", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preview, not production-ready, and europe-west3 unsupported."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_rejected_all_twelve_realms", "label": "Rejected: declaring all twelve realms speculatively", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each is another service to deploy, monitor and scan for customers who do not exist."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_run_app_hostnames_permanent", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_move_project_never_recreate", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_three_realms_us_eu_gb", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_gb_london_service", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_undeclared_realm_unknown", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_region_loop_in_deploy_workflow", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once_rejected_custom_domain", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0030-the-manifest-commits-to-its-hostnames-and-realms-once.m